<h2>What's New</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Collapse and expand ignore mouse events while the bar is sliding, so a click cannot land on a moving panel.</li>
    <li>Vertical scroll over the collapsed edge tab no longer switches Spaces. Scroll-to-switch stays on the expanded bar.</li>
    <li>The collapsed edge tab is one hit target, including the hover headroom above the icon, not only the inner icon button.</li>
    <li>Dragging a Finder `.app` onto the expanded bar shows an accent drop highlight.</li>
    <li>Extracted bar panel placement into `DockishOSCore.BarGeometry` with tests for expanded, collapsed, and hidden frames.</li></ul>
<p class="footer">DockishOS 0.024</p>
